sequenceDiagram
    actor Manager
    participant FS as FinanceService
    participant Access as AccessService
    participant IE as IdempotentExecutor
    participant DB as MongoDB replica set
    participant OP as OutboxProjector
    Manager->>FS: Record payment + expected account version + idempotency key
    FS->>Access: Require membership and PAYMENT_RECORD
    FS->>IE: Execute scoped command
    IE->>DB: Begin transaction and inspect stored command result
    alt Same key and identical payload already committed
        DB-->>IE: Original result
        IE-->>Manager: Replay original payment
    else New command
        IE->>FS: Execute business operation
        FS->>DB: Read scoped unit account, bank account and charges
        FS->>FS: Validate versions and same-unit allocations
        FS->>DB: Save Payment, Charge changes, UnitAccount and FinancialAccount
        FS->>DB: Append AccountEntry, audit and outbox event
        IE->>DB: Store command fingerprint and result
        IE->>DB: Commit all changes together
        FS-->>Manager: Recorded payment
        OP->>DB: Read committed outbox event
        OP->>OP: Check current membership and in-app preference
        OP->>DB: Create deterministic per-user notifications and mark processed
    end
    Note over FS,DB: Validation or concurrency failure rolls the financial transaction back
